_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":21.2,"pe_forward":18.7,"pb_trailing":2,"pb_forward":1.8,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":3.7,"fcf_to_ev":5.12,"fcf_to_mcap":6.73,"liab_to_assets":56.5,"cash_to_assets":6.9,"current_ratio":1.32,"roe":9.6,"roa":4.2,"moat":{"ticker":"FND","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Floor & Decor 的品牌定位在於提供廣泛的選擇、有競爭力的價格以及專業的客戶服務，尤其是在地板和家居裝飾領域。雖然其品牌知名度正在提升，但相較於 Home Depot 或 Lowe's 等大型家居裝修零售商，其品牌影響力仍有差距。其定價策略主要依賴於規模採購和效率，而非獨特的品牌溢價能力。客戶選擇 Floor & Decor 的主要考量在於產品種類和價格，而非品牌忠誠度，這限制了其定價權的強度。","comment_en":"Floor & Decor's brand positioning focuses on offering a wide selection, competitive pricing, and specialized customer service, particularly in the flooring and home improvement sectors. While brand awareness is growing, it still lags behind larger home improvement retailers like Home Depot or Lowe's. Its pricing strategy relies more on bulk purchasing and efficiency than on unique brand premium capabilities. Customers primarily choose Floor & Decor for product variety and price rather than brand loyalty, which limits the strength of its pricing power."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"Floor & Decor 的業務模式主要基於零售和產品分銷，其核心競爭力並非來自專利技術或受監管的特許經營權。公司營運所依賴的技術和流程，例如供應鏈管理和店面營運，通常是行業標準或可被競爭對手模仿的。因此，在專利和監管壁壘方面，Floor & Decor 幾乎沒有顯著的護城河。其成功更多地取決於營運效率和市場策略，而非受法律保護的獨特優勢。","comment_en":"Floor & Decor's business model is primarily based on retail and product distribution; its core competitive strengths do not stem from patented technologies or regulated franchises. The technologies and processes its operations rely on, such as supply chain management and store operations, are generally industry standards or imitable by competitors. Consequently, Floor & Decor possesses virtually no significant moat in terms of patents and regulatory barriers. Its success depends more on operational efficiency and market strategy than on legally protected unique advantages."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"對於地板和家居裝飾品類的消費者而言，轉換成本相對較低。一旦安裝完成，更換地板或大型家居裝飾的成本和精力都相當可觀，這在一定程度上會鎖定客戶。然而，Floor & Decor 的客戶在下次購買時，仍可能因為價格、款式或便利性而選擇其他零售商。公司透過提供專業的安裝服務和設計諮詢，試圖增加客戶的黏性，但這並非嚴格意義上的高轉換成本壁壘，更多是基於服務和體驗的考量。","comment_en":"For consumers in the flooring and home improvement categories, switching costs are relatively low. Once installed, replacing flooring or major home decor involves considerable cost and effort, which somewhat locks in customers. However, during their next purchase, Floor & Decor's customers might still opt for other retailers due to price, style, or convenience. The company attempts to increase customer stickiness by offering professional installation services and design consultations, but this does not constitute a high switching cost barrier in the strict sense, being more based on service and experience considerations."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"Floor & Decor 的零售業務模式不具備顯著的網絡效應。其銷售額主要來自單一客戶的購買行為，而非由用戶數量增長帶動的價值提升。與社交媒體或市場平台不同，更多客戶的加入並不會直接增加現有客戶的價值或降低其獲取成本。雖然公司透過線上平台提供產品資訊和服務，但這並未形成強大的網絡效應，其業務增長主要依賴於開設新店和提升單店銷售額。","comment_en":"Floor & Decor's retail business model does not exhibit significant network effects. Its sales primarily derive from individual customer purchases rather than value enhancement driven by an increase in user numbers. Unlike social media or marketplace platforms, the addition of more customers does not directly increase the value for existing customers or lower their acquisition costs. Although the company provides product information and services through its online platform, this has not created strong network effects; its business growth relies mainly on opening new stores and increasing same-store sales."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Floor & Decor 透過其龐大的採購量和高效的供應鏈管理，在成本控制方面展現出顯著的規模優勢。作為地板和家居裝飾領域的專業零售商，其與供應商的議價能力較強，能夠獲得更低的採購成本。此外，其直營模式和標準化的店面營運有助於降低營運費用。這種規模帶來的成本優勢使其能夠提供更具競爭力的價格，並在市場上保持一定的利潤空間，這是其重要的護城河。","comment_en":"Floor & Decor demonstrates a significant scale advantage in cost control through its massive purchasing volume and efficient supply chain management. As a specialized retailer in the flooring and home improvement sector, it possesses strong bargaining power with suppliers, enabling it to secure lower procurement costs. Furthermore, its direct-to-consumer model and standardized store operations help reduce operating expenses. This scale-driven cost advantage allows it to offer more competitive prices and maintain a certain profit margin in the market, constituting an important moat."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Floor & Decor 的業務主要集中在美國，雖然其門店網絡不斷擴張，但其地理位置的獨特性並非其核心競爭力。其門店選址通常考慮人流量、目標客群的可及性以及租賃成本，這些都是標準的零售選址策略。公司並未擁有或依賴特定地理區域的獨特資源或市場地位，其競爭優勢更多體現在全國性的供應鏈和營運效率上，而非局部的地理壟斷。","comment_en":"Floor & Decor's business is primarily concentrated in the United States. While its store network is continuously expanding, the uniqueness of its geographical locations is not its core competitive strength. Store site selection typically considers foot traffic, accessibility for the target demographic, and rental costs, all standard retail location strategies. The company does not own or rely on unique resources or market positions in specific geographic areas; its competitive advantage is more evident in its nationwide supply chain and operational efficiency rather than localized geographic monopolies."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Floor & Decor 在營運效率方面表現出色，這構成了其重要的護城河。公司透過優化庫存管理、高效的物流配送系統以及標準化的店面營運流程，顯著降低了營運成本。其專注於地板和相關家居裝飾品類的專業化經營，使其能夠更深入地理解和滿足客戶需求，並在採購、銷售和服務環節實現高度協同。這種卓越的營運能力轉化為更低的成本和更高的客戶滿意度，從而鞏固了其市場地位。","comment_en":"Floor & Decor excels in operational efficiency, which forms a significant moat for the company. By optimizing inventory management, implementing efficient logistics and distribution systems, and standardizing store operating procedures, it has significantly reduced operational costs. Its specialized focus on flooring and related home decor items allows for a deeper understanding and fulfillment of customer needs, achieving high synergy in procurement, sales, and service. This operational excellence translates into lower costs and higher customer satisfaction, thereby solidifying its market position."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Floor & Decor 的管理層在資本配置方面展現出較為穩健的策略，尤其是在支持業務擴張和提升股東價值方面。公司持續將資本投入於開設新店、優化現有門店以及改善供應鏈基礎設施，以實現持續的有機增長。雖然其股息和股票回購政策相對保守，但其對核心業務的投資回報率（如 ROE 9.6%）顯示出有效的資本運用。未來若能進一步平衡增長投資與股東回報，其資本配置能力將更為突出。","comment_en":"Floor & Decor's management demonstrates a relatively sound strategy in capital allocation, particularly in supporting business expansion and enhancing shareholder value. The company consistently invests capital in opening new stores, optimizing existing ones, and improving supply chain infrastructure to achieve sustained organic growth. Although its dividend and share repurchase policies are relatively conservative, its return on investment in core operations (e.g., ROE 9.6%) indicates effective capital utilization. Further balancing growth investments with shareholder returns in the future would make its capital allocation capabilities even more prominent."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Floor & Decor 透過提供優質的產品、專業的服務和良好的購物體驗來培養客戶忠誠度。其專業銷售人員能夠提供詳細的產品知識和安裝建議，這有助於建立客戶信任。然而，地板和家居裝飾品類的購買頻率相對較低，且市場競爭激烈，客戶容易受到價格和促銷活動的影響。公司透過會員計劃和個性化推薦來嘗試提高客戶回購率，但其客戶黏性並非無懈可擊，仍有提升空間。","comment_en":"Floor & Decor cultivates customer loyalty by offering quality products, professional service, and a positive shopping experience. Its specialized sales staff can provide detailed product knowledge and installation advice, which helps build customer trust. However, the purchase frequency for flooring and home decor items is relatively low, and the market is highly competitive, making customers susceptible to price and promotional influences. The company attempts to increase repeat purchase rates through its loyalty program and personalized recommendations, but its customer stickiness is not impregnable and has room for improvement."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Floor & Decor 所處的家居裝飾行業具有一定的週期性，但地板和基礎家居裝飾的需求相對穩定，不易受到經濟波動的劇烈影響，這為公司提供了較好的業務可持續性。其專注於特定品類的經營模式，以及在成本控制和營運效率方面的優勢，使其能夠在不同經濟環境下保持競爭力。只要公司能持續適應市場趨勢和消費者偏好變化，其業務模式具有相當的長期韌性。","comment_en":"The home improvement industry, where Floor & Decor operates, has a certain cyclical nature. However, the demand for flooring and basic home decor is relatively stable and less susceptible to severe economic fluctuations, providing the company with good business sustainability. Its specialized business model focused on specific categories, along with its advantages in cost control and operational efficiency, enables it to remain competitive across different economic environments. As long as the company can continuously adapt to market trends and changing consumer preferences, its business model possesses considerable long-term resilience."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Floor & Decor 的護城河主要建立在其卓越的營運效率和規模經濟帶來的成本優勢之上，使其能夠提供具競爭力的價格和廣泛的產品選擇。這使其在特定家居裝飾領域具備類似「商品型」企業的特徵，依賴於高效的供應鏈和精準的成本控制來獲取利潤。然而，其品牌影響力、網絡效應和專利壁壘相對薄弱，轉換成本也非極高，這限制了其護城河的深度。公司在資本配置和客戶留存方面表現穩健，但仍需持續強化品牌價值和客戶忠誠度，以應對市場的潛在顛覆。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Floor & Decor's moat is primarily built upon its exceptional operational efficiency and the cost advantages derived from economies of scale, enabling it to offer competitive pricing and a wide selection of products. This gives it characteristics similar to a 'commodity-like' business in the specific home decor sector, relying on an efficient supply chain and precise cost control for profitability. However, its brand influence, network effects, and patent barriers are relatively weak, and switching costs are not extremely high, limiting the depth of its moat. The company performs solidly in capital allocation and customer retention, but it must continue to strengthen brand value and customer loyalty to counter potential market disruptions.","evidenceHash":"3081abedbfaf6c080a55227c102a51c36b66902c450fbd4b1d6708c72bca52ac","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Gemini"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"3081abedbfaf6c080a55227c102a51c36b66902c450fbd4b1d6708c72bca52ac","currentEvidenceHash":"3081abedbfaf6c080a55227c102a51c36b66902c450fbd4b1d6708c72bca52ac"},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-25","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-13T07:58:38.897Z","evidenceHash":"a281da2d474f2cc5dd1dcaa9cda69e2239d4b52d9660900f3fe5072682b3dcfe"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-25","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-13T07:58:38.897Z","evidenceHash":"a281da2d474f2cc5dd1dcaa9cda69e2239d4b52d9660900f3fe5072682b3dcfe"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/FND.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/FND.png","website":"https://www.flooranddecor.com","ceo":"Bradley S. Paulsen","full_time_employees":"12096","description":"Floor & Decor Holdings, Inc. functions as a leading multi-channel business, acting as both a specialized retailer and a commercial distributor of hard surface flooring and its related accessories. The company provides a wide array of flooring options, such as tile, wood, laminate, vinyl, and natural stone, along with decorative and installation components. It serves a broad customer base, including professional installers, commercial clients, and do-it-yourself customers. As of May 5, 2022, the company boasted a significant physical presence with 166 large-format retail warehouses and five design studios spread across 34 states. Its products are also available online via its website, FloorandDecor.com. Founded in 2000, the company was initially known as FDO Holdings, Inc. before rebranding as Floor & Decor Holdings, Inc. in April 2017. Its headquarters are located in Atlanta, Georgia.","description_en":"Floor & Decor Holdings, Inc. functions as a leading multi-channel business, acting as both a specialized retailer and a commercial distributor of hard surface flooring and its related accessories. The company provides a wide array of flooring options, such as tile, wood, laminate, vinyl, and natural stone, along with decorative and installation components. It serves a broad customer base, including professional installers, commercial clients, and do-it-yourself customers. As of May 5, 2022, the company boasted a significant physical presence with 166 large-format retail warehouses and five design studios spread across 34 states. Its products are also available online via its website, FloorandDecor.com. Founded in 2000, the company was initially known as FDO Holdings, Inc. before rebranding as Floor & Decor Holdings, Inc. in April 2017. Its headquarters are located in Atlanta, Georgia.","description_zh":"Floor & Decor Holdings, Inc.（美股代碼：FND）為 Consumer Cyclical 領域之重要企業，專注於 Home Improvement 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"2500 Windy Ridge Parkway SE","city":"Atlanta","state":"GA","zip":"30339","country":"US","phone":"404 471 1634","full_address":"2500 Windy Ridge Parkway SE, Atlanta, GA 30339, US","range_52w":"42.64-77.46","year_high":77.46,"year_low":42.64,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":42.64,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-08-10","name":"TAYLOR THOMAS V","title":"director, officer: Executive Chair","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":218189,"price":21,"total_val":4.58},{"date":"2026-08-10","name":"TAYLOR THOMAS V","title":"director, officer: Executive Chair","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":218189,"price":62.3,"total_val":13.59},{"date":"2026-08-10","name":"TAYLOR THOMAS V","title":"director, officer: Executive Chair","is_buy":null,"action":"G-Gift","shares":16969,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-10","name":"